<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="mathml_mfenced_test" xml:lang="zh-CN">
    <title>mfenced（括号/绝对值）渲染测试</title>
    <shortdesc>Oxygen 公式编辑器导出的括号和绝对值默认都用 mfenced 表示，而 Chromium 的 MathML Core 实现不认识这个标签，会把整个 mfenced 连同其中内容一起丢弃。这两个公式取自真实报告的问题，用于确认括号/竖线会被展开成显式的 mo 字符而不是消失。</shortdesc>
    <body>
        <section id="section_aspectratio">
            <title>aspectRatio（分母括号）</title>
            <p>分母的两个求和项应各自被一对圆括号包住：
                <mathml>
                    <m:math xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
                        <m:msub>
                            <m:mrow><m:mi mathvariant="normal">aspectRatio</m:mi></m:mrow>
                            <m:mrow><m:mi mathvariant="normal">i</m:mi></m:mrow>
                        </m:msub>
                        <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                        <m:mfrac>
                            <m:mrow>
                                <m:mi mathvariant="normal">D</m:mi>
                                <m:mo>×</m:mo>
                                <m:mi mathvariant="normal">N</m:mi>
                                <m:mo>×</m:mo>
                                <m:mi mathvariant="normal">V</m:mi>
                            </m:mrow>
                            <m:mrow>
                                <m:mfenced separators="|">
                                    <m:mrow>
                                        <m:munderover>
                                            <m:mo>∑</m:mo>
                                            <m:mrow><m:mi mathvariant="normal">j</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
                                            <m:mrow><m:mi mathvariant="normal">N</m:mi></m:mrow>
                                        </m:munderover>
                                        <m:msub>
                                            <m:mrow><m:mi mathvariant="normal">A</m:mi></m:mrow>
                                            <m:mrow><m:mi mathvariant="normal">j</m:mi></m:mrow>
                                        </m:msub>
                                    </m:mrow>
                                </m:mfenced>
                                <m:mo>×</m:mo>
                                <m:mfenced separators="|">
                                    <m:mrow>
                                        <m:munderover>
                                            <m:mo>∑</m:mo>
                                            <m:mrow><m:mi mathvariant="normal">j</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
                                            <m:mrow><m:mi mathvariant="normal">N</m:mi></m:mrow>
                                        </m:munderover>
                                        <m:msub>
                                            <m:mrow><m:mi mathvariant="normal">N</m:mi></m:mrow>
                                            <m:mrow><m:mi mathvariant="normal">j</m:mi></m:mrow>
                                        </m:msub>
                                    </m:mrow>
                                </m:mfenced>
                            </m:mrow>
                        </m:mfrac>
                    </m:math>
                </mathml>
            </p>
        </section>
        <section id="section_orthqual">
            <title>OrthQual（绝对值竖线）</title>
            <p>分子应显示为一对竖线包住的绝对值：
                <mathml>
                    <m:math xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
                        <m:mi mathvariant="normal">OrthQual</m:mi>
                        <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                        <m:msub>
                            <m:mrow><m:mi mathvariant="normal">max</m:mi></m:mrow>
                            <m:mrow><m:mi mathvariant="normal">i</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow>
                        </m:msub>
                        <m:mo>{</m:mo>
                        <m:mfrac>
                            <m:mrow>
                                <m:mfenced close="|" open="|" separators="|">
                                    <m:mrow>
                                        <m:msub>
                                            <m:mrow><m:mi mathvariant="normal">angle</m:mi></m:mrow>
                                            <m:mrow><m:mi mathvariant="normal">j</m:mi></m:mrow>
                                        </m:msub>
                                    </m:mrow>
                                </m:mfenced>
                            </m:mrow>
                            <m:mrow><m:mn>90</m:mn></m:mrow>
                        </m:mfrac>
                        <m:mo>}</m:mo>
                    </m:math>
                </mathml>
            </p>
        </section>
        <section id="section_checklist">
            <title>验证要点</title>
            <ul>
                <li>aspectRatio 分母的两个求和项各自应看到一对圆括号 ( )，不是求和符号裸露在外没有括号</li>
                <li>OrthQual 分子应看到一对竖线 | |，不是没有任何绝对值符号</li>
                <li>如果括号/竖线完全不见了（不是变成别的符号，是彻底消失），说明 mfenced 又被当成浏览器原生认识的标签直接透传，没有展开成 mo</li>
            </ul>
        </section>
    </body>
</topic>
